WEBVTT

00:03:57.024 --> 00:04:02.738
this efflorescence of culture
is not what we usually refer to

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.532
as civilization.

00:04:05.491 --> 00:04:12.164
Instead, that term is usually reserved
for harshly unequal societies,

00:04:12.164 --> 00:04:14.500
which came thousands of years later.

00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:17.962
Dynastic Mesopotamia. Pharaonic Egypt.

00:04:18.004 --> 00:04:19.338
Imperial Rome.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:23.009
Societies that were deeply stratified.

00:04:23.426 --> 00:04:25.636
So in short,

00:04:25.678 --> 00:04:29.348
I've always felt that there was
basically something very weird

00:04:29.348 --> 00:04:32.518
about our concept of civilization,